    "rationale_segment_specific": "The 'Multiple Sclerosis Franchise' corresponds to U.S. product revenue from external customers for MS therapies (TECFIDERA, VUMERITY, AVONEX, PLEGRIDY, TYSABRI, FAMPYRA) as reported in the geographic revenue tables under 'U.S.' in both filings. The values are explicitly listed under 'Product revenue from external customers' for the U.S. in each year, and represent the core MS portfolio. The latest filing (FY2024) reports U.S. product revenue for 2021–2023, and the older filing (FY2021) reports U.S. product revenue for 2018–2020, enabling a complete 6-year consecutive history. The unit is 'M $' as stated by '(In millions)' in both tables."
